{"sections":[{"slug":"局部环化空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"局部环化空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环化空间</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"局部环化空间"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">局部环化空间是指每个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/茎","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">茎</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环化空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环化空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">使用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环化意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环化意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的语言</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">局部环化空间是一个环化意象</span> $(\\mathcal E,R)$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathcal E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">注意内语言中的局部环不用极大理想定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而是用可逆元定义</span>).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}